WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.942
The login redirect is fixed.

2
00:00:01.942 --> 00:00:04.538
This task is waiting for me to decide

3
00:00:04.538 --> 00:00:06.160
whether to add a test.

4
00:00:06.887 --> 00:00:08.637
With several AI tasks running,

5
00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:11.087
I ask the butler on my phone:

6
00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:12.837
which one needs my reply?

7
00:00:12.837 --> 00:00:15.287
It finds this one on the Mac.

8
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.371
I open the task

9
00:00:17.371 --> 00:00:19.060
and read its recent messages.

10
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.840
Then I ask for a reply draft.

11
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.823
I pick one, edit it in the text box,

12
00:00:25.823 --> 00:00:27.480
and decide when to send.

13
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.620
The app is called Office Town.

14
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.620
I wanted tasks and logs

15
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:35.020
from different computers in one place.

16
00:00:35.753 --> 00:00:37.816
I'd also like AI to follow up

17
00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:39.585
on some tasks on its own.

18
00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:41.353
That part is still in progress.

19
00:00:42.087 --> 00:00:43.441
Do you check each window,

20
00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:45.607
or wait for the AI to tell you?
